<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>开场 / 本场地图</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>前半场把问题逼出来，后半场给答案</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24}}><Box style={{width: 460, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 88, fontWeight: 700, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.0, letterSpacing: -1}}>前 42 min</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55}}>前半场把问题逼出来——五层演变 + 那圈东西里头。</Text><Box style={{height: 1, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.18)", marginTop: 8}}></Box><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 88, fontWeight: 700, color: "#0F6E56", lineHeight: 1.0, letterSpacing: -1, marginTop: 8}}>后 42 min</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55}}>后半场给答案——它是不是变量 + 两个进展 + 怎么判断。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 668, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", gap: 20, paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", flex: 1}}>五层演变</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)"}}>P5–P13</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "#0F6E56"}}>17 min</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", gap: 20, paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", flex: 1}}>那圈东西里头</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)"}}>P14–P23</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "#0F6E56"}}>20 min</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", gap: 20, paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", flex: 1}}>它是不是变量</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)"}}>P24–P30</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "#0F6E56"}}>13 min</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", gap: 20, paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", flex: 1}}>两个进展</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)"}}>P31–P38</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "#0F6E56"}}>16 min</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", gap: 20, paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", flex: 1}}>怎么判断</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)"}}>P39–P42</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "#0F6E56"}}>9 min</Text></Box><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)", marginTop: 10}}>节奏：9 次呼吸 · 11 个信息块 · 单块不超过 10 分钟</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>04 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
